efore it is defined, and remove sentences that say nothing specific. If a change holds up, leave it alone; if nothing needs fixing, reproduce the documents unchanged.\n\nOutput the documents, complete and in this order, as:\n<documents>\n<document name=\"paper.tex\">\n...\n</document>\n</documents>","rootUserInstruction":"","memories":[],"workingDirectory":"/golden/project"},"binding":{"backend":"validation","declinedRoutes":[]}}');
